Running the test suite
======================

Install SNooPy in editable mode (so that "import snpy" picks up this
working tree rather than a stale copy in site-packages) together with the
test dependencies:

    pip install -e ".[test]"

Then run pytest from the repository root (or from this folder -- the suite
no longer depends on the invoking directory):

    pytest

The shared fixtures in conftest.py copy the data files into an isolated
temporary directory for every test, so relative-path reads resolve and
files written by the tests do not touch the source tree.

The Milky-Way E(B-V) is pinned to 0.041 for SN2006ax by conftest.py. The
test of the SFD map values (test_sfd_dust.py) runs only when the SFD_DIR
environment variable points to the maps; otherwise it is skipped.
